    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6476416?u=496ab0d7fe561805172fc907e81e97aaa8ca5ec9&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Add <code class=\"notranslate\">openssl</code> to the build to enable signature information in <code class=\"notranslate\">modinfo</code> etc.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As NixOS uses deterministic module signing by default now (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5739794155\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/571181\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/571181/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/571181\">#571181</a>), it only makes sense to add support to inspection utilities like <code class=\"notranslate\">modinfo</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Tested baseline with kmod 31 from unstable/master, not 34.2 in staging <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4547887719\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/525525\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/525525/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/525525\">#525525</a>. Test with binary from <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> confirms the new output.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Before:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ modinfo sd_mod\n...\nsig_id:         PKCS#7\nsigner:         \nsig_key:        \nsig_hashalgo:   unknown\nsignature:      \"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">$ modinfo sd_mod\n...\nsig_id:         PKCS#7\nsigner:         \nsig_key:        \nsig_hashalgo:   unknown\nsignature:      \n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ modinfo sd_mod\n...\nsig_id:         PKCS#7\nsigner:         ko\nsig_key:        7F:7E:C0:E0:6C:53:B5:07:A5:D3:E4:E0:44:45:D8:96:C1\nsig_hashalgo:   sha256\nsignature:      30:45:02:20:1A:DD:31:22:12:D9:2C:68:C1:2E:C3:B2:E1:9B:29:94:\n\t\t63:38:AA:78:C7:AA:5E:66:D9:A3:A6:CD:91:F2:76:B2:02:21:00:C9:\n\t\tB9:69:B1:3D:9A:AA:C1:9A:0E:F1:D9:1B:41:00:2E:EF:1D:5D:B5:86:\n\t\t14:FC:25:00:87:C8:93:F8:12:AC:06\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">$ modinfo sd_mod\n...\nsig_id:         PKCS#7\nsigner:         ko\nsig_key:        7F:7E:C0:E0:6C:53:B5:07:A5:D3:E4:E0:44:45:D8:96:C1\nsig_hashalgo:   sha256\nsignature:      30:45:02:20:1A:DD:31:22:12:D9:2C:68:C1:2E:C3:B2:E1:9B:29:94:\n\t\t63:38:AA:78:C7:AA:5E:66:D9:A3:A6:CD:91:F2:76:B2:02:21:00:C9:\n\t\tB9:69:B1:3D:9A:AA:C1:9A:0E:F1:D9:1B:41:00:2E:EF:1D:5D:B5:86:\n\t\t14:FC:25:00:87:C8:93:F8:12:AC:06\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#automationai-policy\">automation/AI policy</a>.</li>\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Basic functionality of all binary files, usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/doc/release-notes\">Nixpkgs Release Notes</a>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Package update: when the change is major or breaking.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/doc/manual/release-notes\">NixOS Release Notes</a>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module addition: when adding a new NixOS module.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module update: when the change is significant.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
